;; SNOS application memory description. @BANK@ is substituted with the app's
;; ROM bank (e.g. c8) and @ANEAR_LO@/@ANEAR_HI@/@AFAR_LO@/@AFAR_HI@ with the
;; app's ARENA SLOT bounds by tools/buildapp.sh.
;;
;; An app is linked for ONE specific bank. That is not a limitation to work
;; around — it is the design (PLAN.md §1). Cart ROM is already executable, so
;; binding an app to a bank at link time is what removes the need for a loader
;; and a relocator entirely. M10 step 4 extends the same move to DATA: an app
;; is linked for one specific region of the arena, declared in the Makefile
;; (APP_ARENA_*), and two apps may run at once exactly when their regions are
;; disjoint. The address ranges below ARE the enforcement — an app that
;; outgrows its slot fails to link, loudly, today; it does not corrupt its
;; neighbour at runtime, three weeks from now.
;;
;; RAM comes in two very different flavours here:
;;   - stack and direct page MUST be in bank $00, because the 65816 puts them
;;     there and nowhere else. Apps are LINKED against process slot 1's
;;     addresses, but the linked addresses only fix offsets: Calypsi reaches
;;     both through the S and D registers, so the kernel can run the same
;;     binary in any slot (M10 step 3).
;;   - everything else lives in the app's arena slot in WRAM bank $7F.

(define memories
  '((memory DirectPage
            (address (#x1900 . #x19ff))   ; slot 1's DP; offsets-only, see above
            (type RAM)
            (section registers ztiny tiny))

    (memory Stack
            (address (#x1200 . #x17ff))   ; slot 1's stack, 1536 B (measured:
            (type RAM)                    ; worst app high-water is 1,123)
            (section stack))

    (memory AppNear
            (address (#x@ANEAR_LO@ . #x@ANEAR_HI@))
            (type RAM)
            (qualifier near)
            (section data znear near fastregs))

    (memory AppFar
            (address (#x@AFAR_LO@ . #x@AFAR_HI@))
            (type RAM)
            (qualifier far)
            (section heap zfar far huge))

    (memory AppROM
            (address (#x@BANK@0000 . #x@BANK@ffff))
            (type ROM)
            (qualifier far)
            (section (appheader #x@BANK@0000)
                     code compactcode farcode cdata cnear cfar chuge switch
                     itiny idata inear ifar ihuge data_init_table))

    (block stack (size #x600))
    (base-address _DirectPageStart DirectPage 0)
    (base-address _NearBaseAddress AppNear 0)
    ))
